mpl/review are one, merge zero, confirmed close-only closure, completion only afterward, and durable new reviewed basis before closure. Retain the not-ready missing-basis gap assertion without inferred completion.\n  - Add ready replay of the original deleted foreign-source capped text with no recoveryRecords. Assert impl/review/merge/close-only are zero, completed excludes bd-101, stopReason is recovery-held, and recovery.gaps retains exact unresolved source/line. Do not infer unrelated scope. Add supplied-foreign-source recoveryRecords coverage proving ownership cannot be bypassed, while retaining the current-ledger missing/truncated/empty/malformed cases.\n  - Run exactly the three required commands on the fixed task source, record revision/diff and complete results, and require all assertions to pass. Do not alter unrelated replay assertions, snapshot baselines, digest tests, schema, specs or historical evidence, or add a recovery-reader dispatch."
        }
